  "starter": "-- Write your SQL query below\n\n",
  "statementHtml": "<p>Table: <code>Customers</code></p>\n\n<div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Column Name</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>customer_id</td><td>int</td></tr><tr><td>customer_name</td><td>varchar</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>customer_id is the column with unique values for this table.<br/>customer_name is the name of the customer.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Table: <code>Orders</code></p>\n\n<div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Column Name</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>order_id</td><td>int</td></tr><tr><td>customer_id</td><td>int</td></tr><tr><td>product_name</td><td>varchar</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>order_id is the column with unique values for this table.<br/>customer_id is the id of the customer who bought the product &quot;product_name&quot;.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Write a solution to report the customer_id and customer_name of customers who bought products <strong>&quot;A&quot;</strong>, <strong>&quot;B&quot;</strong> but did not buy the product <strong>&quot;C&quot;</strong> since we want to recommend them to purchase this product.</p>\n\n<p>Return the result table <strong>ordered</strong> by <code>customer_id</code>.</p>\n\n<p>The result format is in the following example.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Input: <br/>Customers table:</p><div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>customer_id</th><th>customer_name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Daniel</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Diana</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Elizabeth</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Jhon</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Orders table:</p><div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>order_id</th><th>customer_id</th><th>product_name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>10</td><td>1</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>1</td><td>B</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>1</td><td>D</td></tr><tr><td>40</td><td>1</td><td>C</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>2</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><td>60</td><td>3</td><td>A</td></tr><tr><td>70</td><td>3</td><td>B</td></tr><tr><td>80</td><td>3</td><td>D</td></tr><tr><td>90</td><td>4</td><td>C</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Output:</p><div class=\"statement-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>customer_id</th><th>customer_name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Elizabeth</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Explanation: Only the customer_id with id 3 bought the product A and B but not the product C.</p>",
